<!doctype html><html><head><title>New client · CallBack</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css"></head><body><main class="card wide"><a href="/">← Clients</a><h1>Onboard a client</h1><form method="post"><input name="_csrf" value="<%=csrf%>" type="hidden"><label>Business name<input name="name" required></label><label>Trade<input name="trade" required></label><label>Contact email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>Public business number (E.164)<input name="phone" placeholder="+353..." required></label><label>Phone setup<select name="mode"><option value="TWILIO_FORWARD">A — Twilio number forwards to owner</option><option value="CONDITIONAL_FORWARD">B — carrier conditionally forwards to Twilio</option></select></label><label>Callback number (Mode A)<input name="callbackPhone" placeholder="+353..."></label><label>Cooldown minutes<input name="cooldownMinutes" type="number" value="60" min="1"></label><label>SMS template<textarea name="template">Hi, this is [Business Name]. Sorry we missed your call. Reply with your name and what you need, and we will get back to you. Reply STOP to opt out.</textarea></label><button>Create client</button></form></main></body></html>
